@startuml
' AmbuDock — Application / Data Architecture (clean & bilingual)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam linetype ortho
hide stereotype
title AmbuDock — Application / Data Architecture

' ---------------- ROW #1 : Client & External ----------------
together {
  package "Client (WebApp / 클라이언트)" as CLIENT {
    [React SPA] as CLIENT_APP
  }

  cloud "External Data Providers (외부 데이터 소스)" as EXT {
    [NMC ER/ICU API] as NMC
    [MOIS Alerts] as MOIS
    [Kakao Local / ReverseGeo] as KAKAO
    [TMAP Routing REST] as TMAP
  }
}

' ---------------- ROW #2 : Backend API & DB ----------------
together {
  package "AmbuDock Backend (Spring Boot)" as BE {
    [API Controllers\n(Spring MVC)] as API
  }
  database "RDS MySQL\n(운영 DB)" as DB
}

' ---------------- ROW #3 : Pipelines / Proxy / Audit ----------------
together {
  package "Schedulers / Pipelines\n(수집·정합 파이프라인)" as PIPE {
    [A1 Master Onboarding] as A1
    [A2 Status Loader (60s)] as A2
    [A3 HLI Calculator (60s)] as A3
    [A4 Disaster Ingest (180s)] as A4
    [A5 Alert↔Region Map] as A5
  }

  [TMAP Proxy Service] as PROXY
  [Audit / Score Log] as AUDIT
}

' ================= FLOWS (숫자 라벨; 상세는 Legend) =================
' Ingestion / Compute
KAKAO --> A1 : P1
A1 --> DB : P2
NMC --> A2 : P3
A2 --> DB : P4
A3 --> DB : P5
A3 --> AUDIT : P6
MOIS --> A4 : P7
A4 --> DB : P8
A4 --> A5 : P9
A5 --> DB : P10

' Public API
CLIENT_APP --> API : C1
API --> DB : C2
API --> CLIENT_APP : C3

CLIENT_APP --> API : C4
API --> DB : C5
API --> CLIENT_APP : C6

CLIENT_APP --> API : C7
API --> DB : C8
API --> CLIENT_APP : C9

' TMAP Proxy
CLIENT_APP --> PROXY : T1
PROXY --> TMAP : T2
PROXY --> CLIENT_APP : T3

' ---------------- NOTES (compact) ----------------
note right of A3
HLI Calculator (every 60s)
- score = ER(hvec) + ICU adjust
- level = GREEN/YELLOW/RED/GRAY
- lag_sec = now - hvidate
- latest 1:1 per hpid
(HLI 계산: 60초 / 최신 1:1 저장)
end note

note right of A4
Disaster Ingest (every 180s)
- severity: BLOCK/WARN/IGNORE
- TTL → is_active
- A5 maps to admin regions
(재난 수집: 180초 / TTL 만료)
end note

note right of PROXY
TMAP Proxy
- request: origin + K≤10 × {car,walk}
- returns: ETA, route_km, line_km
- cache 2m, timeout 1.5s
(경로 위임/캐시/타임아웃)
end note

note right of DB
Core Tables (indexes)
- hospital(hpid PK, name_norm, lat, lon, addr_road, region_code)
- hospital_status(hpid, hvidate, hvec, hv2..hv6, hvoc)
- hli_snapshot(hpid PK, status_id FK, score, level, lag_sec)
- disaster_alert(id PK, issued_at, severity, ttl, is_active)
- alert_region_map(alert_id, region_code)
end note

' ---------------- LEGEND (영·한) ----------------
legend right
**Client API (from SPA / 클라이언트 호출)**
C1  GET /api/hospitals?center&radius_km
C4  POST /api/disasters/evaluate (hpids[])
C7  GET /api/hospitals/{hpid}

**API ↔ DB**
C2  read hospitals + HLI / 병원+HLI 조회
C5  read alerts/regions → blocked,severity,badges / 경보·지역 조회
C8  read ICU detail (hv2..hv6,hvoc, icu_avail) / 상세

**API → Client**
C3  hospitals list + HLI / 목록+요약
C6  evaluate result / 평가결과
C9  detail payload / 상세응답

**Pipelines (배치/잡)**
P1  Kakao geocode/reverse / 지오코딩
P2  upsert Hospital / 마스터 적재
P3  NMC status pull / 상태 수집
P4  upsert HospitalStatus
P5  upsert HliSnapshot (latest)
P6  write score/penalty log
P7  pull MOIS alerts
P8  upsert DisasterAlert
P9  classify → A5 / 지역 매핑
P10 upsert AlertRegionMap

**TMAP**
T1  POST /api/tmap/route
T2  call TMAP REST / 경로·ETA 위임
T3  ETA/route_km/line_km
endlegend
@enduml
